---
/** HTML version of a comment thread on a project library document (the ledger migration plan). */
import './mock.css';
---

<div class="mk lib">
  <p class="lib-file"><span class="lib-ico">▤</span>ledger-migration-plan.md</p>
  <div class="lib-panel">
    <p class="lib-head"><b>Comments</b><span class="mk-meta">×</span></p>
    <div class="lib-thread">
      <p class="who"><span class="mk-avatar">TA</span><b>Tomás Alvarez</b><span class="mk-meta">1h ago</span><span class="mk-badge mk-badge--amber">Open</span></p>
      <p class="quote">Backfill runs as a background job in batches of 5,000 rows.</p>
      <p>The backfill batches of 5,000 rows will still lock big merchants for a while. Can we throttle it further during business hours?</p>
      <div class="reply">
        <p class="who"><span class="mk-avatar">CD</span><b>Camille Durand</b><span class="mk-meta">1h ago</span></p>
        <p>Let’s cap it at 500 rows per batch during business hours and widen it back overnight.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="actions"><span class="mk-btn mk-btn--ghost">Reply</span><span class="mk-btn mk-btn--ghost">Resolve</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .lib {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 12px;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .lib-file {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .lib-ico {
    color: var(--mk-green);
  }

  .lib-panel {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .lib-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .lib-thread {
    display: grid;
    gap: 7px;
    padding: 10px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--mk-line);
    background: var(--mk-surface);
  }

  .who {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .who .mk-badge {
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  .quote {
    padding-left: 8px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--mk-muted);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--mk-blue);
  }

  .reply {
    display: grid;
    gap: 3px;
    margin-left: 8px;
    padding-left: 8px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--mk-line);
    color: var(--mk-muted);
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
  }
</style>
